(PRODUCT SUMMARY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AIA Secure Guard Term is a regular premium term life insurance plan that provides financial) Tj
T*
(protection for your loved ones in the event of death or total and permanent disability \(TPD\)) Tj
T*
(during the policy term. It is designed for individuals who want high protection coverage at) Tj
T*
(an affordable premium, without any cash value or savings component.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHO IS IT FOR) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This plan suits primary income earners aged 18 to 60 who want to close a protection gap for) Tj
T*
(their dependents - for example, replacing 5 to 10 years of income, covering an outstanding) Tj
T*
(home loan, or funding children's education should the life assured pass away prematurely.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(KEY BENEFITS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Death Benefit: 100% of the sum assured is paid to the nominated beneficiary upon death of) Tj
T*
(the life assured during the policy term. Total and Permanent Disability Benefit: 100% of the) Tj
T*
(sum assured is paid on diagnosis of TPD before age 65, subject to policy conditions.) Tj
T*
(Guaranteed Renewability: the policy can be renewed up to age 75 without further medical) Tj
T*
(underwriting, subject to premium adjustment at each renewal.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(COVERAGE TERM AND PREMIUM) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Policy terms of 10, 15, 20, 25 or 30 years are available, or coverage to a chosen age) Tj
T*
(between 65 and 75. Premiums are level for the selected term and increase upon renewal.) Tj
T*
(Minimum sum assured is SGD 100,000; there is no maximum sum assured, subject to financial) Tj
T*
(underwriting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(FREE-LOOK PERIOD) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(You may cancel this policy within 14 days of receiving it for a full refund of premiums) Tj
T*
(paid, less any medical examination costs incurred.) Tj
